// Grading: index 0 segment = wall-adjacent at the low end (fine at low end, r).
// index 1 segment = wall-adjacent at the high end (fine at high end, 1/r).
Transfinite Curve {1} = N+1 Using Progression r;
Transfinite Curve {2} = N+1 Using Progression 1/r;
